          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "1. 查看端口号的三类方法"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "1-查看端口号的三类方法"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "1.1 根据端口号查占用（最常用）"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "11-根据端口号查占用最常用"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "# 方式一：lsof（推荐，信息最全）\nlsof -i:端口号\n\n# 方式二：netstat + grep\nnetstat -nltp | grep 端口号"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "示例：查看 8080 端口被谁占用"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "$ lsof -i:8080\nCOMMAND   PID USER   FD   TYPE DEVICE SIZE/OFF NODE NAME\njava    12345 root   32u  IPv6 123456      0t0  TCP *:8080 (LISTEN)\n\n$ netstat -nltp | grep 8080\ntcp6       0      0 8080                 *                    LISTEN      12345/java"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "解析：PID=12345，程序为 java —— 端口已被该进程监听。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "1.2 根据进程 PID 查端口"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "12-根据进程-pid-查端口"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "netstat -nap | grep pid"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "示例：查 PID 12345 监听了哪些端口"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "$ netstat -nap | grep 12345\ntcp6       0      0 8080                 *                    LISTEN      12345/java\ntcp6       0      0 9090                 *                    LISTEN      12345/java"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "同一进程可同时监听多个端口，此命令会全部列出。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "1.3 根据程序名查端口（补充）"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "13-根据程序名查端口补充"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "# 按进程名定位 PID，再反查端口\nlsof -i | grep java"
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
